nt reference.","type":"strength"},{"text":"Slides were uncluttered and focused on key content.","type":"strength"},{"text":"Use an interactive periodic table tool to explore trends dynamically.","type":"improvement","technique":"Interactive Technology"},{"text":"Invite students to use devices for a short research task on element applications.","type":"improvement","technique":"Student Research"}]}],"performance_summary":{"key_strengths":[{"text":"Card-sort activity drove genuine student debate and active participation","dimension":"Engagement"},{"text":"Misconceptions were identified and re-taught promptly during questioning","dimension":"Formative Assessment"}],"areas_for_improvement":[{"text":"Formative assessment is infrequent and relies on a single questioning episode","dimension":"Formative Assessment"},{"text":"The lesson lacks a strong opening hook to contextualise new content","dimension":"Clarity"}]}}',
